{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12234040","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12234040","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1223404001:1":{"text":"すぐに送り届けろ！今すぐだ！","source_cn":"我要你们现在就给我发货！立刻！马上！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x97EED08F7E257C93","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1223404002:1":{"text":"まぁ落ち着いて。すでに貨物車が向かってるし、俺たちが怠ったみたいな言い方はよしてくれ。","source_cn":"冷静点老哥，你这样好像我们有货故意不给你们发一样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA88AA7B73B02AD70","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1223404003:1":{"text":"そんなことなど知らん！とにかく今すぐ必要なんだ！","source_cn":"我不管你们有没有货，我现在就要！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA780B5CFAE4E631","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1223404004:1":{"text":"分かった。信頼できる従業員を手配して、そちらに急行するよう伝える。","source_cn":"你看要不这样吧，我让靠谱的兄弟过去催催，马上给你安排上发货。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA4071AFB80C62364","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1223404005:1":{"text":"おい、新米。はぐらかすつもりじゃないだろうな？何人手配するんだ！？","source_cn":"小子，你又搪塞我是吧！？你叫几个弟兄去了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2C5FF0CD510829A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","docum